# config.json

🟨 json schema for `config.json`

ℹ️ this is an extra unnecessary thing, just for fun or more info

see [config.schema.json](./json/config.schema.json) for schema

validate your config file:

```bash
# install ajv-cli
npm install -g ajv-cli
# download and save the schema in your .near folder then
ajv validate -s config.schema.json -d config.json --spec=draft7
```

---

## Config Field Reference

### Top Level Fields

| Field                         | Description                                                                     |
| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `max_loaded_contracts`        | Max number of contracts cached in memory (default: 32)                          |
| `genesis_file`                | Path to genesis.json (default: "genesis.json")                                  |
| `genesis_records_file`        | Path to genesis records file (default: null)                                    |
| `validator_key_file`          | Path to validator key file (default: "validator_key.json")                      |
| `node_key_file`               | Path to node key file (default: "node_key.json")                                |
| `tracked_shards_config`       | Which shards to track (RPC default: "AllShards", Validator default: "NoShards") |
| `log_summary_style`           | Log output format: "colored" or "json" (default: "colored")                     |
| `enable_multiline_logging`    | Enable multi-line log formatting (default: false)                               |
| `gc_blocks_limit`             | Garbage collection block limit (default: 2)                                     |
| `gc_fork_clean_step`          | Garbage collection fork clean step (default: 100)                               |
| `gc_num_epochs_to_keep`       | Number of epochs to keep for garbage collection (default: 5)                    |
| `view_client_threads`         | Number of view client threads (default: 4)                                      |
| `state_sync_enabled`          | Enable state sync (default: true)                                               |
| `transaction_pool_size_limit` | Transaction pool size limit (default: 100000000)                                |

### Duration Fields

Duration objects contain `secs` and `nanos` (e.g. `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}` = 10 seconds).

| Field                           | Description                                                                 |
| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `log_summary_period`            | Log summary reporting interval (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)        |
| `state_request_throttle_period` | State request throttle period (default: `{"secs": 30, "nanos": 0}`)         |
| `gc_step_period`                | Garbage collection step period (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 500000000}`) |

### RPC Section (`rpc`)

| Field                               | Description                                         |
| ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `addr`                              | RPC server listen address (default: "0.0.0.0:3030") |
| `prometheus_addr`                   | Prometheus metrics address (default: null)          |
| `cors_allowed_origins`              | Allowed CORS origins (default: `["*"]`)             |
| `enable_debug_rpc`                  | Enable debug RPC endpoints (default: false)         |
| `experimental_debug_pages_src_path` | Path to debug pages source (default: null)          |

