| Field              | Description                                                           |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `polling_interval` | Polling interval (default: `{"secs": 0, "nanos": 200000000}` / 200ms) |
| `polling_timeout`  | Polling timeout (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)                 |

**`limits_config`**

| Field                   | Description                                      |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `json_payload_max_size` | Max JSON payload size (default: 10485760 / 10MB) |

### Telemetry Section (`telemetry`)

| Field                | Description                                                                        |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `endpoints`          | Telemetry reporting endpoints (default: `["https://telemetry.nearone.org/nodes"]`) |
| `reporting_interval` | Telemetry reporting interval (default: `{"secs": 10, "nanos": 0}`)                 |

### Network Section (`network`)

| Field                                   | Description                                                                  |
| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `addr`                                  | P2P network listen address (default: "0.0.0.0:24567")                        |
| `boot_nodes`                            | Comma-separated boot nodes format `ed25519:key@ip:port` (default: "")        |
| `whitelist_nodes`                       | Whitelisted nodes (default: "")                                              |
| `max_num_peers`                         | Maximum number of peers (default: 100)                                       |
| `minimum_outbound_peers`                | Minimum outbound peer count (default: 16)                                    |
| `ideal_connections_lo`                  | Ideal connections lower bound (default: 60)                                  |
| `ideal_connections_hi`                  | Ideal connections upper bound (default: 80)                                  |
| `peer_recent_time_window`               | Peer recent time window (default: `{"secs": 600, "nanos": 0}` / 10min)       |
| `safe_set_size`                         | Safe set size for archival nodes (default: 20)                               |
| `archival_peer_connections_lower_bound` | Lower bound for archival peer connections (default: 10)                      |
| `handshake_timeout`                     | Handshake timeout (default: `{"secs": 20, "nanos": 0}`)                      |
| `skip_sync_wait`                        | Skip sync wait on startup (default: false)                                   |
| `ban_window`                            | Ban window (default: `{"secs": 10800, "nanos": 0}` / 3 hours)                |
| `blacklist`                             | Blacklisted peers (default: `[]`)                                            |
| `ttl_account_id_router`                 | TTL for account ID router (default: `{"secs": 3600, "nanos": 0}` / 1 hour)   |
| `peer_stats_period`                     | Peer stats reporting period (default: `{"secs": 5, "nanos": 0}`)             |
| `monitor_peers_max_period`              | Monitor peers max period (default: `{"secs": 60, "nanos": 0}`)               |
| `peer_states_cache_size`                | Peer states cache size (default: 1000)                                       |
| `peer_expiration_duration`              | Peer expiration (default: `{"secs": 604800, "nanos": 0}` / 7 days)           |
| `public_addrs`                          | Public addresses (default: `[]`)                                             |
| `allow_private_ip_in_public_addrs`      | Allow private IPs in public addresses (default: false)                       |
| `trusted_stun_servers`                  | STUN servers for NAT traversal (default: `["stun.l.google.com:19302", ...]`) |

**`network.experimental`**

| Field                             | Description                                  |
| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| `inbound_disabled`                | Disable inbound connections (default: false) |
| `connect_only_to_boot_nodes`      | Only connect to boot nodes (default: false)  |
| `skip_sending_tombstones_seconds` | Skip sending tombstones (default: 0)         |

